{"version":1,"content":"<p>全球網站廣泛使用的程式語言PHP存在嚴重安全漏洞，多國政府周三（21日）緊急關閉網站，避免被黑客乘虛而入。</p><p>PHP的開發團隊周三已緊急發布更新版本，修復軟體中潛藏多年、直到近期才藉由人工智慧（AI）技術發現的漏洞，呼籲所有用戶立即更新。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:03:04.494340+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:17:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T07:38:21.919761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:57:51.655013+00:00","content_hash":"67845eb435429d41db646e62af3c359c87759e3a90b4cd73a39241fc43df3486","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}